{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是星期六。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟纱凪一起出门购买给理央君的圣诞礼物。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯～果然还是另一边比较好吧？”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4359", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然这边也很好勾啦……”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4360", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她勾着我的手，我们首先逛逛商店的橱窗。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪正在烦恼要勾我的右手还是左手。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，果然还是这边吧。”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4361", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后她选了右手。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为扮男装吗？今天的纱凪很积极。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么说来，这是我们交往后第一次约会吗？”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4362", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你这么一说，的确是。”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前都是一起来买社团的备品，所以没什么特别的感受。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也没有像这样大方地勾着手逛街的经验。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸嘿嘿，感觉真不错呢♪”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4363", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也这么想。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉不太好意思，还有一点点的骄傲。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天的纱凪看起来比平常更耀眼。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是在旁人看来，我们两个男的勾着手是不是很不妙？”", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4364", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛，我是觉得纱凪不会被当成男的……”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不管怎么看都是男人吧！你看，胸部也是平的。”", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4365", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一开始我也以为她是理央君的“哥哥”，所以现在无法反驳。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是现在的纱凪不管怎么看都是可爱的女孩子。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是我让她变成这样的，这让我有点骄傲。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有要帮胸部说点客套话？”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4366", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我觉得没有小到需要这么在意。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的？好～那今天起我就自称巨乳吧♪”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4367", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪一笑，我就产生温度上升了２、３度的错觉。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "果然不可能被当作两个男人。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……啊，但是被看成男人就没有意义了。”", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4368", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过要是传出新吾跟男人交往的谣言，那好像也挺有趣的。”", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4369", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“居然事不关己地觉得有趣啊。”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为要是有那种谣言，那就不会有奇怪的虫子黏上你很好啊♪”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4370", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不准吐槽说我就是奇怪的虫子。”", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4371", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪勾着我的手臂，表情变来变去的。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "光是看着这样的她就让我觉得被疗愈了。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，先去买给理央君的礼物吧。”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么一说，那才是今天的目的呢。”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4372", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不小心当成一般的约会了♪”", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4373", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“其实那样也不错。”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，呐呐，你看那个！那件衣服，好可爱喔！”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4374", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只有一次也好，我也好想穿那种轻飘飘的衣服喔。”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4375", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你可以穿啊，我觉得一定很适合。”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不行不行，那种衣服要美羽学姐那种人穿才可爱。”", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4376", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，对面的衣服也好可爱！新吾，这边这边！”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4377", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我被她拉着转来转去，逛了许多商店。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一想到昨天我亲吻了这女孩的脸颊，就觉得有点害羞。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪。”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，怎么了？”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4378", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虎牙好可爱。”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、虎牙？”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4379", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你笑起来非常可爱。”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4380", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……是吗？被人这么说还是第一次。”", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4381", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，被说这种话会让人羞耻到笑不出来啦！”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4382", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那种害羞的表情也很可爱。”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4383", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有惊讶的表情也是。”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“客、客套话就不用了。我会不知道该摆什么样的表情啦！”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4384", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她还是一样不知道自己有多可爱。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一般的男人根本无法忽视她的存在。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听隼太说，班上也有很多偷偷喜欢她的人……", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔！”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1753", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4385", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪突然停下脚步。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "随即便听到耳熟的声音。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唷，居然在这里遇到。”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1754", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，隼太也来买东西吗？”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是没错啦。”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1755", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一看到隼太纱凪就放开了我的手。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后拉低帽檐，躲到我背后。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个时期人真多啊。”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1756", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“毕竟快到圣诞节了。”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太当然发现纱凪了，但他刻意不提起。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且他也有自己的状况。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，抱歉。我们有点赶时间。”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1757", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“再见啦新吾。”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 284, "voice": "_ht1758", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“再见。”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太转身离开，躲在他背后的女孩子也小跑着跟上他。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太身边也带了一个人，我们默契地彼此都没提起。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那个女孩该不会是椋梨的女朋友？”", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4386", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，没错。”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4387", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……怎么了？”", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没什么，我还以为椋梨喜欢的是更高调一点的女孩子……”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4388", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟看隼太的外表，纱凪会这样想也不奇怪。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉是个很安静的女孩。”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4389", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "外表也很低调不显眼。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过不知道为什么，他们好相配喔，好像看着就觉得是一对……”", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4390", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“走在一起的样子也很自然，感觉好好喔……”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4391", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那是他父母决定的未婚妻，已经认识很久了的样子。”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿～是这样啊……”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4392", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4393", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "目送隼太他们离开后，纱凪的情绪突然变得消沉。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“累了吗？”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有，只是有点沮丧。”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4394", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“沮丧？为什么？”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为打扮成男生的我……没办法像那两个人一样……”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4395", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我总有一天也能变成像椋梨的女朋友那样吗？”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4396", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“变成跟新吾走在一起很自然的女孩子……”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4397", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对纱凪来说，现在很不自然的样子。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“别人是别人，我们是我们。”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“继续逛街吧？”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4398", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“去那间店看看玩偶吧？”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这次选一个比生日礼物的玩偶更大的吧。”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，那可以让我来选吗？”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4399", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你已经有主意了吗？”", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，有个跟熊喵外型很像的，非常大的玩偶。”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4400", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像叫国王什么的……总之你看到一定也会被它的巨大吓到。”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4401", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我很期待。”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那走吧，这边这边！”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 276, "voice": "_sn4402", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然跟刚才的话题无关，但虎牙真的好可爱呢。”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 267, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
